==Trivia==
*The illustration rare print of this card features the exterior of the [[Valley Windworks]], where {{p|Drifloon}} can be found in Generations {{gen|IV}} and {{gen|VIII}}.
**Additionally, this print shows a calendar marked on [[Friday]], the only day that Drifloon appears.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Stormfront|Drifloon|58}} from the {{TCG|Stormfront}} expansion.
*'''Expand''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vending|Wigglytuff|S1}} from {{TCG|Expansion Sheet 1}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

